    13	Fix: hold exactly ONE `xcrun mcpbridge` child process for the whole life of this
    14	daemon, and front it with a Streamable HTTP MCP server. Every downstream client
    15	(kicker nodes, Claude Code, Codex — anything that can speak MCP-over-HTTP) points
    16	at this daemon's URL instead of spawning mcpbridge itself. Xcode approves ONE PID,
    17	once, and stays approved as long as this daemon (and its mcpbridge child) keep running.
    18	
