    20	  - SINGLE-upstream (default, what's been running since 2026-08-14): fronts just
    21	    one upstream (normally mcpbridge). Dumb passthrough — tool names forwarded
    22	    unprefixed, exactly as the upstream advertises them. This is the deployed
    23	    xcode-mcp-front daemon; nothing about its behavior changes in this mode.
    24	  - MULTI-upstream (XCODE_MCP_FRONT_UPSTREAMS set): fronts several upstreams
    25	    behind the SAME endpoint, tool names prefixed per-upstream
    26	    (`<name>__<tool>`, e.g. `xcode__BuildProject`, `drews__run_project_unmonitored`)
