    97	        # rename on 2026-08-26: install-doctrine.sh never registered them, so the updater did not
    98	        # know they existed and reported everything current. A distribution mechanism that is
    99	        # silent about what it does not cover is worse than one that covers less and says so.
   100	        paths = meta.get("paths", {})
